cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or reduced data, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Sequence-context analysis of human CpG and non-CpG methylation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kovalchuk"
    given-names: "Igor"
version: "1.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SlonikOlla/sequence-context-methylation"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for analyses of local sequence-context effects on
  human CpG and non-CpG methylation across WGBS datasets, motor-neuron CpH
  methylation, and matched normal-tumor liver BS/oxBS data.
keywords:
  - DNA methylation
  - CpG
  - CpH
  - DNMT1
  - DNMT3A
  - DNMT3B
  - WGBS
  - sequence context
  - epigenomics
  - cancer methylome
